e\">Watch: Artemis II mission loses contact with Earth for 40 minutes</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Once contact was regained, astronaut Christina Koch said: \"It is so great to hear from Earth again.\"</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\">US &amp; Canada</span></p></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c0q97yk0p28o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div data-testid=\"edinburgh-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260407-092955-f3cfe0ee04-web-3.0.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 20vw, (min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 800px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/f8eb/live/74dbd680-31fc-11f1-a79a-77e93010d956.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Four astronauts are seen in their spaceship.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Moment Artemis II sets record for distance humans have travelled from Earth</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">The crew broke a previou